  "summary": "Backstage may expose sensitive information in Scaffolder task failure events",
  "details": "### Impact\n\nUnder specific template and failure conditions, an authenticated user may be able to retrieve sensitive values from Scaffolder task events. This can expose backend-managed credentials used during task execution.\n\n### Patches\n\nPatched in `@backstage/plugin-scaffolder-backend` version `4.1.0`\n\n### Workarounds\n\n- Restrict Scaffolder template execution and task-event access to trusted users until the patched version is deployed.",
